# This repo IS the live site: every tracked file is published at
# giottosafricanstore.com. So the rule here is not "keep the repo tidy", it is
# "do not put anything on the public web that was never meant to be there".

# Working folders that are ours, not the shop's.
ToReview/
.claude/

# A screenshot tool once wrote its output to a literal "undefined" folder.
undefined/

# The seed spreadsheet the catalogue was first built from. The live build reads
# the Google Sheet, not this file, so it has no business being downloadable.
data/products-seed.csv

# OS cruft.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editor and tooling leftovers.
node_modules/
*.log
